### Secrets ###
# This project is 100% offline (ADR-0002) and should need no keys at all.
# If one ever appears, it must never reach the repository.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

### On-device model weights ###
# The Gemma .task/.litertlm checkpoint is >1 GB (ADR-0004). It is shared
# out-of-band (USB / file transfer), never committed.
/assets/models/
*.task
*.litertlm
*.tflite
